            'category_id' => 6,
            'user_id' => 1,
            'title' => 'New Home',
            'description' => '<p>So I started to set up a mini-website to place my writings into the virtual world. I\'ve been writing random stuffs that springs up in my mind through my notebooks for the past few years as a result of boredom and I decided to keep a backup in the Internet incase they get lost or something XD. This blog was created on Friday, March 27 2015.</p><p>So how did I sprang to this site? I remembered visiting a page with a WordPress subdomain on it (just like this one) a couple of years ago. Then last week, I was thinking of transferring all my works in the Internet so that the hassle of writing would be lessened. Plus, I can keep backup records just in case. So I thought of the word "wordpress", searched it on Google and I came here. :D</p><p>As readers, this blog will let you see my works. Works that are a product of my imagination and wits. I\'ll start adding them bit by bit as I visit this site. :D</p><p>~ Kevin T. Decena</p>',
