        Post::create([
            'category_id' => 7,
            'user_id' => 1,
            'title' => 'Unholy Confessions #4',
            'description' => '<p style="text-align:center;">"Insurgent"</p><p>I\'ve been really anticipated to watch <a href="#insurgent-ref-1"><span style="text-decoration:underline;">Insurgent</span><sup>1</sup></a> since the movie trailers came out. The movie just started showing in cinemas last week. Since then, I\'ve been so eager to watch it. That\'s when I invited Jocel to watch the movie together. Jocel was slated to return on March 23, 2015 at night. She even asked me if we could watch the last full show for that night and I agreed to it.</p><p>So that day came and she didn\'t bother sending a text message to notify me whether we would watch or not. She said her father is sick and there\'s no one to look after him. I respected it and she promised to be at Baguio by Thursday (March 26, 2015). Still a no-show Jocel happened. Either she postponed her arrival or she is still busy. Whatever it is, I am still hoping to see her.</p><p>A week has passed and still no word from her. I couldn\'t contain my anticipation any longer so tonight, I watched Insurgent alone. I bought an Oreos blizzard ice cream from Dairy Queen and went inside the cinema to watch. I sat in front and enjoyed the movie with the company of my own bag sitting beside me (hahaha). Since then, we hardly contact each other.</p>
            <ul>
                <li><a id="insurgent-ref-1"></a><sup>1</sup> - this is the sequel to the 1st movie "Divergent", based on a novel of the same name by Veronica Roth.</li>
            </ul>',
            'created_at' => Carbon::parse('June 6, 2015 00:00:00')->format('Y-m-d H:i:s'),
            'date_published' => '2015-03-30',
        ]);

        Post::create([
            'category_id' => 7,
            'user_id' => 1,
            'title' => 'Unholy Confessions #5',
            'description' => '<p style="text-align:center;">"Samsung S5"</p><p>Since October 2010, I\'ve held my Samsung Galaxy Mini S5570 phone tightly in my grasps for more than 4 years. I never bothered to change my phone. The only time I would change it is when the phone\'s lifespan starts deteriorating. Until it\'s still functional, I would continue to use it. That day really came. Last May 1, 2015, I scheduled that day to have my haircut and to buy a Bench/ wax for my hair. For unknown reasons, my lock and back buttons stopped functioning. Then a couple of weeks later, my battery\'s life has gradually deteriorated (I have to charge it everyday). I guess this is the time to really be convinced to change my phone.</p><p>My dad and brother arrived at Baguio in the wee hours of the morning. To my surprise, they bought a <a href="#samsung-s5-ref-1"><span style="text-decoration:underline;">Samsung Galaxy S5</span><sup>1</sup></a> for me. The phone looks so astonishing! I\'m so happy they bought it in time because I\'m hanging on by a thread trying to survive with my current phone. I told Mama about this and she\'s so delighted to hear it because she can now call me better at <a href="#samsung-s5-ref-2"><span style="text-decoration:underline;">Viber</span><sup>2</sup></a> haha!</p><p>I\'m so excited in trying my new phone soon. I still have a lot of files such as music and pictures in my old phone that needs to migrate in the new phone. The wait is worth it! The agony has ended!</p>
            <ul>
                <li><a id="samsung-s5-ref-1"></a><sup>1</sup> - during a chat with Mama sometime ago, I asked her which is better: Samsung S5 or Samsung S3. Samsung S5 happened to be Mama\'s preferred phone for me.</li>
                <li><a id="samsung-s5-ref-2"></a><sup>2</sup> - this is a mobile app that lets you communicate with people who has the same app for free (call and text) as long as they have a Viber account too.</li>
            </ul>',
            'created_at' => Carbon::parse('June 6, 2015 00:00:00')->format('Y-m-d H:i:s'),
            'date_published' => '2015-05-29',
        ]);

        Post::create([
