                <p style="margin-left:2em;">When the internet goes down</p>
                <p style="margin-left:2em;">My face paints a frown</p>
                <p style="margin-left:2em;">The day feels slow and boring</p>
                <p style="margin-left:2em;">Without you, I am nothing</p>
            <p style="text-align:left;">III.</p>
                <p style="margin-left:2em;">Having an internet connection is everyone\'s happiness</p>
                <p style="margin-left:2em;">No access to e-mails, news, social medias, is our loneliness</p>
                <p style="margin-left:2em;">Sadly, this is today\'s generation</p>
                <p style="margin-left:2em;">The would-be product of the next incarnation</p>
            <p style="text-align:left;">IV.</p>
                <p style="margin-left:2em;">No internet is such a dull day</p>
                <p style="margin-left:2em;">I am bored and yawning, you may say</p>
                <p style="margin-left:2em;">Internet, don\'t leave me like other girls do</p>
                <p style="margin-left:2em;">We have known each other for 12 years, too</p>
            <p>This poem was created due to having no internet connection for the past 3 days.</p>',
