        Post::create([
            'category_id' => 7,
            'user_id' => 1,
            'title' => 'Unholy Confessions #13',
            'description' => '<p style="text-align:center;">"Video Editing"</p><p>One of my interests is to be a video editor. I want to learn how to edit videos and share my finished product for people to watch and to be entertained by my creativity. It\'s actually for my YouTube gaming channel that I already created a couple of years ago. After some canvassing and careful thinking, I want to use Vegas Pro 16 as my video editor. I managed to find a crack version of it and was able to install it to my computer on May 25, 2019. I used a clip from my recorded League of Legends video where I used Blitzcrank to outplay an enemy Fizz.</p><p>I familiarized myself with video editing. It\'s an amazing experience to learn something new and I took this opportunity to strike whilst the iron is hot. Some of the effects I used are freezing a frame, applying slow motions, and adding video clips. It took me 2 days to finish editing my 1st video (I had to rest for a couple of days and make it my leisure time). I finished it on May 31, 2019 and uploaded it to my YouTube channel on the same date too.</p>',
            'created_at' => Carbon::parse('December 25, 2019 00:00:00')->format('Y-m-d H:i:s'),
            'date_published' => '2019-12-25',
        ]);

        Post::create([
            'category_id' => 7,
            'user_id' => 1,
            'title' => 'Unholy Confessions #14',
            'description' => '<p style="text-align:center;">"Resident Evil 2 Remake Pre-Order"</p><p>Last January 23, 2019, I pre-ordered the PC version of Resident Evil 2 Remake for P500 along with Alyza, Patrick, and Ate Collen. The pre-order comes with a shirt, poster, and 2 DLC codes for the Samurai Edge handgun - Jill Valentine\'s and Chris Redfield\'s versions of it. The game was released on January 25, 2019. It\'s been a long time since I pre-ordered a game. In fact, the last game I pre-ordered was Resident Evil 6 back in 2012. I couldn\'t play this remake as the game\'s specs couldn\'t meet my old CPU\'s specs back then. I still opted to buy it due to my fondness for Resident Evil games.</p><p>On January 27, 2019, I paid P700 to get the game and poster. The shirts weren\'t available then. I went back on February 5, 2019 for the shirt but I got the small size as it was the last shirt left in DataBlitz. I had no choice but still felt lucky enough.</p>',
            'created_at' => Carbon::parse('December 25, 2019 00:00:00')->format('Y-m-d H:i:s'),
            'date_published' => '2019-12-25',
        ]);

